WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:02.020
My ex-boyfriend, Nick,

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.200
I really do have his
name tattooed back there.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.740
Do you know how hard it is to get laid

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:07.311
with another man's name on your back?

00:00:07.311 --> 00:00:08.440
(audience laughs)

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:09.313
Not hard.

00:00:10.512 --> 00:00:13.210
(upbeat music)

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:14.820
I was dating a guy for a while.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:15.807
He looked at me and he said,

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:17.807
"It's just that my therapist told me

00:00:17.807 --> 00:00:20.017
that I could tell you that
I was more attracted to you

00:00:20.017 --> 00:00:22.920
when you were exercising
and eating better,"

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:27.033
and I thought is your
therapist your friend, Sean?

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:30.490
I picked up a bunch of condoms

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:35.040
'cause I'm the breadwinner
of most of my relationships.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.330
That always cracks me
up when a dude chimes in

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:40.120
with like she trapped me with a baby.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:45.120
You have the missing
ingredient, and we love to bake.

00:00:45.489 --> 00:00:49.317
♪ Got, got, got, got, got me goin' crazy ♪

00:00:49.317 --> 00:00:51.400
It's more of a man's
game, the happy ending.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.070
Have any women here been
offered a happy ending?

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:56.224
Just an angry silence, okay.

00:00:56.224 --> 00:00:59.057
(audience cheers)

